      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Organization Workplace Policy URN",
      "Anchor": "organization-workplace-policy-urn",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Organization Workplace Policy URN"
      ],
      "Text": "An organization workplace policy URN is a composite URN constructed using the workplace policy ID and the URN of the organization this workplace policy belongs to.\nFor example, a workplace policy with an ID of 222333444111111 for organization URN urn:li:organization:1234 would look like urn:li:organizationWorkplacePolicy:(urn:li:organization:1234,222333444111111).",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Benefit URNs",
      "Anchor": "benefit-urns",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Benefit URNs"
      ],
      "Text": "To get benefits data like name, description etc, you must call dmaBenefits endpoint with relevant benefit ID extracted from BenefitUrn.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Article URNs",
      "Anchor": "article-urns",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Article URNs"
      ],
      "Text": "To get policy article ingested content URL, you must call dmaIngestedContentSummaries endpoint with relevant ingested content ID extracted from policyArticleIngestedContent URN.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
